From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Smith <scott@newtrostudios.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:28:09 -0400
Subject: remotesmith(0603): uninstall removes the tray's autostart and stops
 it

macOS: uninstalling the service unregisters the tray login item (SMAppService),
removes a standalone LaunchAgent, quits the tray and records it as removed so
reopening the app does not bring it back until the service is installed again.
Windows: the installer adds an HKLM Run value for remotesmith-tray.exe; upgrade
stops the tray; uninstall stops it and deletes the HKLM and HKCU Run values.
Serves B5 / AC-39 / FLOW-1.
